      "readMe": "## Labour Entry\n\n`workerId` / `workerName`, `startedAt` / `endedAt` (the Workbench timer writes these) or a typed `hours`, `rate` (AmountWithCurrency), `note`. Computed `effectiveHours` (typed hours win; else the interval, open-ended while running), `cost` = hours × rate, `isRunning`.\n\nGeneric: a work order today; a consulting task, a support case or a lesson tomorrow.",
